{
  "name": "X (Twitter) Account Followers & Bio Website/Email Lead Scraper",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ X (Twitter) Account Followers & Bio Website/Email Lead Scraper\n\n**What this workflow does:**\nExtract founder and developer profiles following top tech accounts on X, complete with bio links and DM openness.\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [`laborious_rumor/twitter-x-followers-following-profile-scraper`](https://apify.com/laborious_rumor/twitter-x-followers-following-profile-scraper) (*First 1,000 results 100% Free — zero login cookies required!*)\n\n### Setup in 30 Seconds:\n1. Get your free Apify API token at [console.apify.com/settings/integrations](https://console.apify.com/settings/integrations).\n2. Open the **Run Apify Fast X (Twitter) User & Followers Scraper** HTTP Request node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. Click **Test Workflow** to extract, deduplicate, and score live structured JSON records!",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 640
      },
      "id": "b41ed321-1ba6-4a94-a44f-e9a366f33faa",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        60
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🔎 Stage 1: Schedule, Target Queries & Apify Extraction\nTriggers daily, sets your target search queries and `maxItems`, and runs the cookie-free **Fast X (Twitter) User & Followers Scraper** Actor synchronously via the Apify REST API.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 740
      },
      "id": "ecaabded-d5d1-4c11-a31c-c45c73f11f85",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 1 Extraction",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### 🧹 Stage 2: Quality Filtering, Deduplication, Lead Scoring & Export\nFilters verified records, deduplicates by URL/ID, normalizes and scores each record with JavaScript, summarizes the batch, and routes high-priority items downstream.",
        "height": 220,
        "width": 980
      },
      "id": "23da7890-dd40-43ca-aa3f-f37cc69fe777",
      "name": "Sticky Note: Stage 2 Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        950,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
